msgctxt "Languages::vendor_locations.text_settings_google_api_notice"
msgid "<div class=\"alert alert-warning\"><p>Google may charge API usage fees. To avoid unexpected charges, set usage limits and billing alerts, or keep limited funds on the payment card used for API billing.</p><p>Learn more about setting up API key <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://docs.cs-cart.com/latest/user_guide/addons/vendor_locations/configure.html\">in the documentation</a>.</p></div>"
msgstr "<div class=\"alert alert-warning\"><p>Google は API 使用料を請求する場合があります。予期せぬ請求を避けるため、使用制限と請求アラートを設定するか、API 請求に使用する支払いカードの残高を制限してください。</p><p>API キーの設定方法については、ドキュメント <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://docs.cs-cart.com/latest/user_guide/addons/vendor_locations/configure.html\">を参照してください。</a></p></div>"

msgctxt "Languages::vendor_locations.text_settings_yandex_api_notice"
msgid "<div class=\"alert alert-warning\"><p>Yandex may charge API usage fees. To avoid unexpected charges, keep limited funds in your Yandex account.</p><p>Learn more about setting up API key <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://docs.cs-cart.com/latest/user_guide/addons/vendor_locations/configure.html\">in the documentation</a>.</p></div>"
msgstr ""

